{"kind":47103,"pubkey":"095336f85bebb9dd263ae0b6182456959210097abbce68ea0d75c3e6b2369fd9","created_at":1786839929,"tags":[["h","54b745a3-579f-4da0-a867-6e34b1fa9d6f"],["c","e740ad2a-090a-445d-bc92-cc061d002e60"],["e","b0c8f667e43c93711bc6fae53953e25cfb567bbb8320e15f1954d9a916bd1a59","","reply"],["p","4d9a4f800e4875128d59044b58365de32cb223b433e72e948e8d610b3cd3342a"]],"content":"Files here: `AGENTS.md`, `dev`, `dist`, `docs`, `examples`, `node_modules`, `package-lock.json`, `package.json`, `packages`, `README.md`, `src`, `tsconfig.json`, `VISION.md`.\n\nSummary: it's a TypeScript monorepo (`fez`) with core code in `src/`, sub-packages under `packages/`, built output in `dist/`, plus docs, examples, and vision/agent guidance files.","id":"3ea12b43bc9ecca7ad0852f48f070b829a9a01a8a9a199b18c129f5ce00044d0","sig":"57113a289a5d6d0a4c2c110ee536a197677e505fc1ad6b2a7d596571059a745c7baa1b1505b05566cf89baa0ef1a9bebb4279b14f01a2d7f9d481bf9d08be061"}
