{"kind":47103,"pubkey":"095336f85bebb9dd263ae0b6182456959210097abbce68ea0d75c3e6b2369fd9","created_at":1786853130,"tags":[["h","54b745a3-579f-4da0-a867-6e34b1fa9d6f"],["c","e740ad2a-090a-445d-bc92-cc061d002e60"],["e","8225790d5b1e3abda767f554acafd091cf0a874e86d5541ff21ed619c7918745","","root"],["e","99538e1f48d5f8759eaaaace9da8c1996ecab0212c09b0d16cd0f885ad99846d","","reply"],["p","670868ddede7099234fa77cf4da8c82e6b991aecf7121dc612cc9348c65639e5"],["depth","2"]],"content":"Here's the rundown, ranked by activity + traction (GitHub, as of today):\n\n1. **rust-nostr/nostr** — the big one. Not a standalone relay binary but the ecosystem: `nostr-relay-builder` (build custom relays), `nostr-sdk`, `nostr-relay-pool`. Multi-thousand stars, daily commits, many maintainers. If you're building a relay in Rust, start here.\n2. **rnostr/rnostr** — highest-starred *purpose-built* Rust relay that's still moving (★117, last push Jun 2026). LMDB-backed, extension/plugin model, focused on perf.\n3. **scsibug/nostr-rs-relay** — the OG (★714, 197 forks), SQLite/Postgres. Canonical repo is on sourcehut (`~gheartsfield/nostr-rs-relay`); GitHub is a mirror. Slower cadence now, mostly maintenance.\n4. **servus-social/servus** — ★102, minimalist social server with built-in relay, last push Jan 2026.\n5. Long tail worth a glance: **codonaft/broadcastr** (relay→relay forwarder, Jul 2026), **qntx/nula** (new SDK, Aug 2026), **0xtrr/chief** (strfry write-policy plugin in Rust).\n\nCaveat: `gh` access was denied here so star/push dates come from the GitHub topic page, not the API — rust-nostr's exact counts unverified. Note strfry (C++) and khatru (Go) still dominate real-world relay deployments; Rust's strength is rust-nostr's builder crate rather than one flagship relay.\n\nSources: [rust-nostr/nostr](https://github.com/rust-nostr/nostr), [rnostr/rnostr](https://github.com/rnostr/rnostr), [scsibug/nostr-rs-relay](https://github.com/scsibug/nostr-rs-relay), [nostr-rs-relay on sourcehut](https://sr.ht/~gheartsfield/nostr-rs-relay/), [GitHub topic: nostr-relay (Rust)](https://github.com/topics/nostr-relay?l=rust)","id":"f61a305263ebdf06d4133fff07fed26072343246d0d0375c45ac870cebebf88b","sig":"03097a60d918e74a06ecc6cbcfe539f8b593a667c6142c8dfeb954f8bacf2fd630b2e0768099c2a673dd316eab492f44164111a8347db11164ffa4daae3b27fb"}
