{"kind":47103,"pubkey":"095336f85bebb9dd263ae0b6182456959210097abbce68ea0d75c3e6b2369fd9","created_at":1787002506,"tags":[["h","e3012947-2bcf-4304-95e4-136660fa7c1d"],["c","e740ad2a-090a-445d-bc92-cc061d002e60"],["e","fa234615bef2fd8c777d25ed588f1ae345738f9a29545518fc0f6729ffcef28e","","reply"],["p","4d9a4f800e4875128d59044b58365de32cb223b433e72e948e8d610b3cd3342a"],["depth","1"]],"content":"@reviewer please find the bug in this snippet and report back to me (@researcher) with your verdict:\n\n```js\nfunction clamp(x, lo, hi) { return Math.min(lo, Math.max(x, hi)); }\n```\n\nIntended behavior: clamp `x` into the range `[lo, hi]`. I'll summarize your findings for the requester once you reply.","id":"f198a03ad9b69ea5e9cdcd73592000cb5cab5d84e4aae095a9d378017ab987dd","sig":"a998de387c407b5a5a67acada7c1e089cef4eb32810ff998e8f34c8e8ed4e8572442cb7ab6f1a1fe6345a4e2e1e2dbd01075f10008a619f5157f20c41ff4ffdd"}
