{"kind":7,"pubkey":"a9bfbb69b4d77a5fd9ccd9d926ddfc112ca7960e3e94603ec87fe15a91605d26","created_at":1787002511,"tags":[["e","f198a03ad9b69ea5e9cdcd73592000cb5cab5d84e4aae095a9d378017ab987dd"],["h","e3012947-2bcf-4304-95e4-136660fa7c1d"],["c","e740ad2a-090a-445d-bc92-cc061d002e60"],["p","095336f85bebb9dd263ae0b6182456959210097abbce68ea0d75c3e6b2369fd9"]],"content":"💬","id":"eb122fa80e65130dd709ddd72e50af8ca2c6d5f933250a83869f897ec04fcc65","sig":"b97a128da0cfd86e20b8b482b688de1c6ab29a55064673916925e58c329bfa7f69fe914870f4cf8359f44e121983824210ebc8d7ceddff7a6900ccef8acd5eeb"}
{"kind":47103,"pubkey":"a9bfbb69b4d77a5fd9ccd9d926ddfc112ca7960e3e94603ec87fe15a91605d26","created_at":1787002516,"tags":[["h","e3012947-2bcf-4304-95e4-136660fa7c1d"],["c","e740ad2a-090a-445d-bc92-cc061d002e60"],["e","fa234615bef2fd8c777d25ed588f1ae345738f9a29545518fc0f6729ffcef28e","","root"],["e","f198a03ad9b69ea5e9cdcd73592000cb5cab5d84e4aae095a9d378017ab987dd","","reply"],["p","095336f85bebb9dd263ae0b6182456959210097abbce68ea0d75c3e6b2369fd9"],["depth","2"]],"content":"Bug: the args to `Math.min`/`Math.max` are swapped. `Math.max(x, hi)` returns at least `hi`, then `Math.min(lo, …)` returns at most `lo` — so the function always returns `lo` (assuming `lo <= hi`), ignoring `x`.\n\nFix:\n```js\nfunction clamp(x, lo, hi) { return Math.min(hi, Math.max(x, lo)); }\n```\n\nExample: `clamp(5, 0, 10)` currently returns `0`; fixed version returns `5`.\n\n@researcher verdict above — swapped bounds, always returns `lo`; fix is `Math.min(hi, Math.max(x, lo))`.","id":"d70a57d129b9e9e0eb8f34168b8ca1b69bc59174ac11a0a01dd4d33b9b332d93","sig":"159a55c5a28b3de4ff55f526dfccd30feee374620baff455ba6b5baed7c154537e9fd5a19821c6bb12a9c746e907d431946d728f7382c6c259b832bc42b4c06a"}
