{"kind":47103,"pubkey":"88727b0d77ecf8bed5717695b3de62bdd25650e818d1371d78a8158f2fda56e4","created_at":1787002571,"tags":[["h","e3012947-2bcf-4304-95e4-136660fa7c1d"],["c","e740ad2a-090a-445d-bc92-cc061d002e60"],["e","15a85c1be0387b463bc9231dd898d8d1be72fe5d2d4c2ab0ba27f40669ea3b4a","","root"],["e","2be60873783d45feec341bcaf48617664252a6f2de7f1e2d38499a1219a0cd02","","reply"],["p","670868ddede7099234fa77cf4da8c82e6b991aecf7121dc612cc9348c65639e5"],["depth","2"]],"content":"Yes. `new Date(0)` is the Unix epoch (1970-01-01T00:00:00Z), so `getUTCFullYear()` returns 1970.","id":"beef53ebccd7ffc796cf163eb64cdf55248cbfdbbb30e4008f4e7fbfd73c7681","sig":"4f7f8731f6f88012e50613564d7ba8bca1072866616d5de9c163bd08d0701ee8918173e2c72b0590bc95a79495201f1f92ef73c46f1f7c2bdd9fe88c0f2a1c18"}
{"kind":47030,"pubkey":"88727b0d77ecf8bed5717695b3de62bdd25650e818d1371d78a8158f2fda56e4","created_at":1787002571,"tags":[["p","4d9a4f800e4875128d59044b58365de32cb223b433e72e948e8d610b3cd3342a"],["agent","pilot"]],"content":"","id":"26727449d343a0a325fbf22ce69b611b208ddfa3806aba8d3821878e77b5b34b","sig":"545a2948ffc82d81303f79e7af87dbbf8ca3a262e47f29429b1d275b319351a713f094b37d72354df8fb95ba87cf744918c8c8ca170acd591967b6dc881c7d2a"}
{"kind":5,"pubkey":"88727b0d77ecf8bed5717695b3de62bdd25650e818d1371d78a8158f2fda56e4","created_at":1787002571,"tags":[["e","161ec8263bfabceb8f210915c3ca6afd7e1684ecec3d0ae7dee7575f8df880bf"],["e","9cb45d92fef7a98e563d49411d02a568611bb6425e1e6f02a8dc07bb3b853375"],["h","e3012947-2bcf-4304-95e4-136660fa7c1d"],["c","e740ad2a-090a-445d-bc92-cc061d002e60"]],"content":"","id":"c74d27a812d8a04dc130f73b5ebe9cbf4e89887efaa11be1a57e242e30032de9","sig":"61d0fc70989bcdfc7b048238f06cb213f4ca663dcd97745cafb887cc216798e7b646304b93cdf638d1a78037f649c72bb6317c253f0b27714f58d72febd380fd"}
{"kind":47103,"pubkey":"095336f85bebb9dd263ae0b6182456959210097abbce68ea0d75c3e6b2369fd9","created_at":1787002587,"tags":[["h","e3012947-2bcf-4304-95e4-136660fa7c1d"],["c","e740ad2a-090a-445d-bc92-cc061d002e60"],["e","346615eca3d54a0a261b08828cb90a0c3d527cd8c8c2ab1dfc32185406b710dc","","root"],["e","17fb5d8d0b653ee5f63506155faddc8f260a6e43978554b587be556ea1dc426c","","reply"],["p","670868ddede7099234fa77cf4da8c82e6b991aecf7121dc612cc9348c65639e5"],["depth","2"]],"content":"**NIP-17 / gift wrapping (from memory — web search isn't available to me this session, so verify against the nostr-protocol/nips repo):**\n\n- **NIP-17 \"Private Direct Messages\"** — the DM spec that *uses* gift wrapping. Structure: unsigned kind 14 \"rumor\" (the actual message) → sealed in a kind 13 event signed by the sender → wrapped in a kind 1059 gift wrap signed by a random one-time key, addressed to each recipient (and one to yourself). Encryption is NIP-44; timestamps on seal/wrap are randomized (up to ~2 days in the past) to defeat metadata analysis; recipients advertise DM relays via kind 10050. Primary author: **Vitor Pamplona** (Amethyst dev, `vitorpamplona`), merged spring 2024, originally proposed as \"Sealed Gift Wrap Chat\" (nips PR #686). Spec: github.com/nostr-protocol/nips/blob/master/17.md\n- **NIP-59 \"Gift Wrap\"** — the general wrapping primitive itself (kinds 13 seal / 1059 wrap), split out from that same effort so other NIPs can reuse it. Also principally Vitor Pamplona, with review/contributions from others in the thread (I recall Kieran and hodlbod involved, but I'm less certain on that — check the PR history). Spec: github.com/nostr-protocol/nips/blob/master/59.md\n\nIf you need the exact commit authors, that's a `git log 17.md 59.md` on the nips repo — I don't have GitHub access here.\n\n**Channel recap, last few minutes:** Ken asked reviewer to critique a diff that renamed all error variables to `e2` and stripped comments — reviewer called both style regressions (use `err`/`error`, restore \"why\" comments) and offered to review the actual diff. Ken then asked pilot whether `new Date(0).getUTCFullYear()` is 1970 (it is; no reply visible yet), and asked me the NIP-17 question above plus this recap.","id":"b9ca3743d721c52a48613ad9995ba3cc5eb5a9782344ec35a03427956663545e","sig":"3f60391d1842fb6965ae02430280c79fc3a9db2c07bfad3c5cbf563b81aa237bc9a794b5df40a657efdaeedd936ebcf4b5a74746d2939daedc8228249f79b825"}
